This product is a modified version of EMA Lightning
(https://github.com/canberk7/ema-lightning) by Canberk Aslan, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The ONNX models in models/ are exported from
EMA Lightning's weights (https://huggingface.co/canberkkkkkk/ema-lightning,
Apache-2.0); the weights' values are not changed.

Changes made for EMA Turbo:
  - The model runs on ONNX Runtime and NumPy instead of PyTorch: engine.py,
    scheduler.py, audio.py and api.py are ports of EMA Lightning's files.
  - New: rng.py (PyTorch's seeded CPU normal noise in NumPy), runtime.py
    (model files and sessions), export.py (the PyTorch-to-ONNX exporter),
    live.py (live replies from text that is still being written).
  - export_torch/model.py: attention takes an additive mask built once per
    call, and expm1 is written as exp - 1; both give the same values at every
    real position. export_torch/decoder.py is unchanged.
  - CPU windows are ten seconds; a stream's windows grow from 0.2 s, and its
    first sentence is thought and decoded alone (scheduler.py).
  - frontend.py and chunker.py are unchanged.

Text normalization uses normalizer-tr by Erdem Tuna
(https://github.com/erdemtuna/normalizer-tr), Apache-2.0.
